                    <br>
                    <i class="subtitle-article">Publisher : </i><xmp class="subtitle-article">Research Center for Biology-Indonesian Institute of Sciences </xmp>
                    <p class="action-article">
                        <a class="btn_show_abstract title-citation" target="764175" onclick="show_abstract(764175)"> Show Abstract</a>
                        | <a class="title-citation" href="http://e-journal.biologi.lipi.go.id/index.php/berita_biologi/article/download/1232/1105" target="_blank">
