                    <a class="title-article" href="/documents/detail/751639">
                        <xmp>ISOLASI DAN UJI PATOGENITAS KAPANG PERUSAK PADA APEL MALANG (Malus sylvestris Mill.) PASCA PANEN </xmp>
                    </a>
                    <a class="author-article" href="/author/view/1817039"><xmp>Shabrina, Andisa</xmp></a>; <a class="author-article" href="/author/view/3454724"><xmp>Sukmawati, Dalia</xmp></a>; <a class="author-article" href="/author/view/281501"><xmp>Hidayat, Iman</xmp></a>                    <br>
